Package: drmTMB
Title: Distributional Regression Models Using Template Model Builder
Version: 0.7.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Shinichi", "Nakagawa", email = "itchyshin@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7765-5182"))
  )
Description: Fast distributional regression models for one or two responses
    using Template Model Builder. Predictors can change an outcome's average,
    residual variability, shape, or probability of zero. Begin with the
    documented tutorials; check the fitted model and the model-specific limits
    before reporting results.
